                </ul>
                <h3>Encrypted Gift Card Codes</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Gift card codes attached to signatures are encrypted using AES-256-GCM before storage. The encrypted data is only decryptable by the card recipient or card creator via an authenticated request.</li>
